flowchart TB
  subgraph BIZ[真实业务入口]
    SESSION[主 Session 工具与对话]
    WATCH[视频探索 / duty 定时收集]
    COMMENT[普通评论、@、楼中楼]
    TRUSTED[主人/可信好友专用评论 Agent]
    DM[普通私信]
    OWNERDM[主人私信 Agent]
    DAILY[每日动态、情绪回顾]
    REFLECT[人生反思和人格成长]
  end
  subgraph COMMON[现有统一层 / 适用时使用]
    DIRECTORY[friendDirectory + socialTier]
    POLICY[SocialPolicyGate 身份与渠道边界]
    ROOT[CommentRootResolver 读取 root / 发送 root]
    VIDEOCTX[commentVideoContext 视频/字幕/主评论/楼中楼/热评]
    SOCIALCTX[SocialContextAssembler 场景化证据装配]
    MEMORY[memoryRetriever 主人/社交/公开视频权限视图]
    MEME[interactionMemeLookup 公共梗知识]
    PERSONA[persona-growth / personality / emotion]
    PRIVACY[interactionPrivacy 公共隐私预检]
  end
  subgraph DECISION[模型、意愿与平台动作]
    BATCH[interactionBatcher 普通社交批处理]
    AGENT[ownerCommentAgent 独立意愿/限额]
    OWNERAGENT[ownerDmAgent 工具规划及单步授权]
    MODEL[invokeInteractionPrompt / invokeMemoryPrompt]
    AUTH[外部动作权限/额度/目标再次检查]
    PLATFORM[Bili MCP / Python _guard / 平台回执]
  end
  subgraph DATA[持久化事实与投影]
    SOCIALSYNC[SocialInteractionCoordinator 社交事件 outbox]
    LIFESYNC[LifeMemoryCoordinator 经历/候选/兴趣 outbox]
    EPISODE[LifeMemoryGateway 可衰减经历]
    REFLECTION[LifeReflection 有效证据反思]
    LONG[LongTermMemory 事实键/日额/待处理]
    CONSOLIDATE[MemoryConsolidator 私密聊天可选凝练]
    FRIEND[friendLearning / friendRelationships / socialCognition]
    CHARACTER[情绪/人格领域投影]
  end
  SESSION --> MEMORY
  SESSION --> LONG
  WATCH --> MEMORY
  WATCH --> LIFESYNC
  COMMENT --> ROOT --> VIDEOCTX
  COMMENT --> DIRECTORY --> POLICY
  TRUSTED --> DIRECTORY
  TRUSTED --> ROOT
  DM --> POLICY
  OWNERDM --> POLICY
  POLICY --> SOCIALCTX
  SOCIALCTX --> MEMORY
  SOCIALCTX --> VIDEOCTX
  SOCIALCTX --> MEME
  SOCIALCTX --> PERSONA
  SOCIALCTX --> PRIVACY
  SOCIALCTX --> BATCH
  SOCIALCTX --> AGENT
  SOCIALCTX --> OWNERAGENT
  BATCH --> MODEL
  AGENT --> MODEL
  OWNERAGENT --> MODEL
  MODEL --> AUTH --> PLATFORM
  PLATFORM --> SOCIALSYNC
  SOCIALSYNC --> FRIEND
  SOCIALSYNC --> LIFESYNC
  LIFESYNC --> EPISODE
  LIFESYNC --> REFLECTION
  REFLECTION --> LONG
  REFLECTION --> CHARACTER
  LONG --> CONSOLIDATE --> LONG
  DAILY --> EPISODE
  REFLECT --> EPISODE
  REFLECT --> LONG
  BORDER[安全原则：公开评论绝不读主人私记忆；原始 DM 正文不进 Life Memory；意愿不等于动作授权]
  BORDER -.-> POLICY
